--- !u!114 &1577314693
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1577314691}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Tuesday, September 14th, 1880



    I no longer believe they are bears.


    Tonight
    one of them opened the back door.


    What troubles me is not merely the attempt,
    but the manner of it. They waited until the household slept and sought entry
    quietly. These are no ordinary animals.


    The refuge beneath the house now
    seems our wisest course. They possess intelligence, of that I am nearly certain,
    and I fear we ourselves are their object of interest.


    Dawn is less than
    an hour away, and I have never observed them in daylight.


    Nevertheless,
    I believe we shall soon be obliged to descend below. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a14a8a1184c5f14fbce3338ea4d7a35, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1260715531048141648, guid: 9a14a8a1184c5f14fbce3338ea4d7a35, type: 2}
