      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Sunday, September 12th, 1880



    I have observed something most peculiar.


    Whilst
    walking the grounds of the manor these past few days, I have more than once caught
    sight of a figure, or perhaps some animal, watching from beyond the windows.
    Whenever it perceives that I have noticed it, it retreats at once into the forest.


    Angelika
    insists they are bears or some other large predator, though I am not persuaded.
    Father''s advice seems the sounder of the two.


    Tomorrow I shall call upon
    Lawson''s in town and purchase a side-by-side sporting gun. That ought to discourage
    bears, or whatever these creatures may be.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a14a8a1184c5f14fbce3338ea4d7a35, type: 2}
