  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Monday, September 13th, 1880



    They are growing bolder.


    No
    longer is there only one. This evening I counted as many as eight beyond the
    house.


    Angelika suggested securing our provisions below, though I doubt
    that alone will rid us of their attention. I shall reinforce the cellar door
    tomorrow. Should these creatures become aggressive, we shall retreat there.


    I
    would rather use the shotgun. Unfortunately, Father is correct: I am no marksman,
    and none of us would fare much better. For now, caution must suffice.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a14a8a1184c5f14fbce3338ea4d7a35, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1260715531048141648, guid: 9a14a8a1184c5f14fbce3338ea4d7a35, type: 2}
